OL,3,GNEWSAChildren sleeping on piles of
OL,4,Aclothes, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA furniture bank said it has been
OL,7,Fhelping families whose children were
OL,8,Fsleeping on floors, piles of clothes
OL,9,Fand other makeshift beds.
OL,11,FPeterborough-based Care Zone, which has
OL,12,Fa warehouse on the edge of the city,
OL,13,Fplans to spend #80,000 this year on
OL,14,Fbeds and mattresses for local families.
OL,16,F"Many children are sleeping on a pile
OL,17,Fof clothes, or maybe just on the hard
OL,18,Ffloor," said Ashley Wilcox from Care
OL,19,FZone, adding: "That's not good enough."
